WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.793
Sequence the fictional guide around a complete action.

00:00:03.793 --> 00:00:08.060
Orient the person to the task and required inputs.

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:11.378
Connect it to their familiar planning work.

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:14.223
Explain quantity, rate and separate cost.

00:00:14.223 --> 00:00:16.119
Demonstrate one worked estimate.

00:00:16.119 --> 00:00:19.912
Give a practice estimate with different supplied figures.

00:00:19.912 --> 00:00:22.757
Review the calculation and visible exclusions.

00:00:22.757 --> 00:00:26.075
Apply the process to permitted project inputs.

00:00:26.075 --> 00:00:29.868
Continue by identifying facts or review still needed.

00:00:29.868 --> 00:00:37.928
This follows orient, learn, practice, review, apply and continue, with connection and demonstration made explicit for teaching.

00:00:37.928 --> 00:00:42.195
Keep content, support and revisions within the saved scope.

00:00:42.195 --> 00:00:45.987
Remove the unrelated AI-history section and software catalog.

00:00:45.987 --> 00:00:54.047
Each retained step should help the person prepare and check the estimate, rather than merely finish reading.
